      "message": "Sorry for confusion: I wrote the first comment when looking on previous version of https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/kernel/common/+/3786919 where `flush_write_buffer` was still used. After I\u0027ve noticed the change I\u0027ve add my second comment and add CR+2: and I am ok with requiring RWBF\u003d0 to avoid complexity.\n\nI am marking this one as resolved to not confuse anyone.",
